WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.750
Module 4: migrating,
governing, and proving it.

2
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.940
Chapter 10 states the finish line:

3
00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:09.225
the migration ends when
governance runs on its own.

4
00:00:09.225 --> 00:00:13.371
Joiners, movers and leavers flow
from the HR record without a ticket,

5
00:00:13.371 --> 00:00:17.814
every privileged session starts with
a phishing-resistant credential,

6
00:00:17.814 --> 00:00:20.850
and drift shows up in a diff
instead of an incident.

7
00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:22.947
We'll cover the governance machinery,

8
00:00:22.947 --> 00:00:27.140
the authentication roadmap and the
eleven-phase playbook from Chapter 10,

9
00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:31.401
then Chapter 11's reference deployment,
which runs the whole sequence on one

10
00:00:31.401 --> 00:00:36.050
representative two-forest estate and shows
what the assessor receives at the end.
